                                "sense_id": "b1823da3-d93b-359b-90e4-9bed7293eb47",
                                "text": "“Are you from Jamaica?” he blurted out. / The Rastafarian stopped and looked at the reporter with soft red eyes. “Who, I? Sí.” / “Are you Rastafari?” Sloman pressed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e1daa0a2-855c-4d44-aeb5-1b499b9b7634",
                                "sense_id": "b1823da3-d93b-359b-90e4-9bed7293eb47",
                                "text": "All that was behind him, he said, for he had become Rastafari and all he wanted to do was to learn black history and spread love and feelings to everybody."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "11d013a4-bf16-4c67-ba5c-89087bd111bf",
                                "sense_id": "b1823da3-d93b-359b-90e4-9bed7293eb47",
                                "text": "Ras Sam Brown, for example, explains why he is Rastafari by situating himself as a link between the past and present: […]"
